# User and Group Management with ACL in Linux

## Aim
To manage users, groups, and file access permissions in a Linux environment using command-line tools.

## Project Structure
- scripts/users.sh → User and group setup commands
- scripts/acl.sh → Access Control List (ACL) commands

## Tools & Commands Used
- Linux OS: Ubuntu
- Commands: useradd, usermod, passwd, groupadd, chown, chmod, setfacl, getfacl
